  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Green Cities 3 W2 -Timisoara DH &amp;amp;amp; Urban Regeneration</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provision of a senior loan in the amount of up to EUR 30 million to the City of  Timisoara (the &quot;Client&quot;, or the &quot;City&quot;) to support, alongside the European  Union (&quot;EU&quot;), key municipal infrastructure investments, as follows: (i)  rehabilitation of the district heating (&quot;DH&quot;) network and (ii) urban  regeneration investments, including public lighting, bike lanes, green spaces,  and irrigation systems (the &quot;Project&quot;).  Improvement of the City&apos;s urban living environment by implementing green and  sustainable infrastructure investments across the city, a priority under the  City&apos;s Green Action Plan.</narrative>
  </description>
